WEBVTT

00:05:59.984 --> 00:06:02.187
Mɛa keš ġul kbir.

00:06:02.187 --> 00:06:04.121
Kayen ġir ḥayya weḥda teqder tdirha

00:06:04.121 --> 00:06:05.955
tnuḍ w twejjed keš kwiyes ‘atey

00:06:05.955 --> 00:06:11.271
W teqɛed mɛa el-xuf w huwa msamik, kima keš bezz.

00:06:11.271 --> 00:06:13.752
Nta el-šaref.

00:06:13.752 --> 00:06:15.639
W el-xuf huwa el-bezz.

00:06:15.639 --> 00:06:17.084
W tehḍer mɛa el-xuf

00:06:17.084 --> 00:06:20.270
W tseqsih weš rahu baġi, weš rahu mestḥeqq.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.887
Kifeš tdir had el-xedma xir?

00:06:24.887 --> 00:06:26.637
Kifeš el-bezz ynejjem yḥes ruḥu yeqwa?

00:06:26.637 --> 00:06:28.086
W tdir keš xuṭṭa.

00:06:28.086 --> 00:06:30.091
W tqul, “Ṣeḥḥa, ḍerwek nɛawdu nwellu nreqdu.